<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Chicken Fried Rice Recipe</title>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Chicken Fried Rice</h1>

  <p>A delicious and easy chicken fried rice recipe made with fresh vegetables, chicken, eggs and rice. Perfect for lunch or dinner!</p>

  <img src="https://cdn.freecodecamp.org/curriculum/labs/recipe.jpg" alt="A freshly prepared homemade recipe dish">

  <h2>Ingredients</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>2 cups cooked rice</li>
    <li>1 cup chopped chicken</li>
    <li>2 eggs</li>
    <li>1 cup mixed vegetables</li>
    <li>2 tablespoons cooking oil</li>
    <li>2 tablespoons soy sauce</li>
    <li>Salt and pepper</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Instructions</h2>

  <ol>
    <li>Cook the rice and set it aside to cool.</li>
    <li>Heat cooking oil in a large frying pan.</li>
    <li>Add the chicken and cook until fully done.</li>
    <li>Add the eggs and stir until scrambled.</li>
    <li>Add the mixed vegetables and cook for a few minutes.</li>
    <li>Add the cooked rice and soy sauce.</li>
    <li>Mix everything well and season with salt and pepper.</li>
    <li>Serve hot and enjoy!</li>
  </ol>

</body>
</html>
